medicine in the laughter.

00:04:22.272 --> 00:04:23.321
I think that's how it gets through.

00:04:23.321 --> 00:04:24.154
- [Kelly] Nice.

00:04:24.154 --> 00:04:25.209
- Medicine in the laughter?

00:04:25.209 --> 00:04:26.042
- [Sam] Yeah.

00:04:26.042 --> 00:04:26.875
- [Jen] Ooh.

00:04:26.875 --> 00:04:27.708
- Put that on a bumper sticker. Yeah.

00:04:27.708 --> 00:04:28.696
